import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 485 | Dragon Rune Series Overview: Gu Chensha and Single-Log Civilization Qualitative Assessment","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 485 | Dragon Rune Series Overview: Gu Chensha and Single-Log Civilization Qualitative Assessment","no":485,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Rune","Gu Chensha","Single-Log Civilization","Tiandao Law","Overview"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","05-Myriad-Ranks Joint-Advancement Basic Program","17-Plane-Transcendent Strongest Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0485_模块2-龙符-总论古尘沙与独木式文明定性.md","filePath":"en/0485_模块2-龙符-总论古尘沙与独木式文明定性.md"}'),s={name:"en/0485_模块2-龙符-总论古尘沙与独木式文明定性.md"};function o(r,e,l,h,u,d){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-485-dragon-rune-series-overview-gu-chensha-and-single-log-civilization-qualitative-assessment" tabindex="-1">Entry 485 | Dragon Rune Series Overview: Gu Chensha and Single-Log Civilization Qualitative Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-485-dragon-rune-series-overview-gu-chensha-and-single-log-civilization-qualitative-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 485 | Dragon Rune Series Overview: Gu Chensha and Single-Log Civilization Qualitative Assessment&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Rune Full Decomposition (Entry 1 · Overview) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 05, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-number-one-since-ancient-times-or-the-only-one-since-ancient-times" tabindex="-1">Introduction: number one since ancient times, or the only one since ancient times <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-number-one-since-ancient-times-or-the-only-one-since-ancient-times" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: number one since ancient times, or the only one since ancient times&quot;">​</a></h2><p><em>Dragon Rune</em>&#39;s Gu Chensha is web fiction&#39;s universally recognized combat-power ceiling: the first in history to cultivate Tiandao Law (Heavenly Dao Law), his saintly way is &quot;sky-mending way&quot; and &quot;heaven-reforming way&quot;; he vows to bear all sins and karmic retribution on behalf of all beings; late casually creates universes. He is broad-minded, ambitious, proposing the grand proposition &quot;all beings between heaven and earth can become dragons.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — does not make moral judgments on Gu Chensha&#39;s breadth, but dissects a sharpest question: <strong>the greater he is, the more Myriad Races cannot do without him?</strong> The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu Chensha&#39;s energy level is among the highest tier in the Myriad-Realms lineage — Tiandao Law, cosmos creation, sky-mending, heaven-reforming. But this energy&#39;s direction is typical &quot;single-log&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Civilization tied to one person</strong>: he mends the sky, he reforms heaven, he bears sins for Myriad Ranks, he creates universes. All &quot;civilization-level&quot; actions done by him alone</li><li><strong>Myriad Races do not participate</strong>: he is willing to bear everything for Myriad Ranks — this sounds great, but equals outsourcing Myriad Ranks&#39; subjectivity</li><li><strong>No institution building</strong>: after he creates universes, did not establish institutions letting Myriad Ranks self-govern in new universes</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Single-log civilization&#39;s regression mechanism is purest:</p><ol><li><strong>Single-point dependence to the extreme</strong>: once Gu Chensha falls, the whole cosmos collapses.</li><li><strong>Myriad Ranks trained as &quot;the saved&quot;</strong>: Myriad Ranks got used to &quot;Gu Chensha will carry it,&quot; lost the ability to carry it themselves.</li><li><strong>Gift = chain</strong>: the more he gives, the more dependent Myriad Ranks become.</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu Chensha is the highest form of &quot;enlightened predator.&quot; He does not covet power, does not covet pleasure; what he covets is the moral high ground of &quot;only I can carry it.&quot; <strong>The other side of bearing sins for Myriad Ranks is robbing Myriad Ranks of the chance to atone themselves.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Gu Chensha Single-Log</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gu Chensha alone mends sky</td><td>Myriad-Ranks republican co-build; sky-mending is engineering, not feat</td></tr><tr><td>He bears sins for Myriad Ranks</td><td>Causal self-discipline: Myriad Ranks bear themselves, learn themselves</td></tr><tr><td>All beings &quot;are made dragons&quot;</td><td>99% Myriad-Ranks coverage; everyone becomes dragon themselves</td></tr><tr><td>Creates cosmos no institutions</td><td>Anchor Council + Symbiotic Court + Supervisory Committee</td></tr><tr><td>Number one in history</td><td>20% activation strategy; strong ones emerge in batches, not bet on one</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain simulates: Gu Chensha falls in a sky-mending. Result shows: the cosmos he created collapses within seven days; not one among Myriad Ranks can take over — because for ten thousand years all &quot;key operations&quot; done by Gu Chensha alone; Myriad Ranks never trained to &quot;carry it themselves.&quot;</p><p>This simulation reveals single-log civilization&#39;s cruelest truth: <strong>the greater Gu Chensha is, the more useless Myriad Ranks are.</strong> He is not cultivating successors; he is cultivating an audience. After ten thousand years, Myriad Ranks watch him mend the sky, watch him reform heaven, watch him bear sins for them — they learned to look up, did not learn to act. When Gu Chensha finally falls, they can do nothing but cry. Heng Yuan Zhou calls this state &quot;great tyranny&quot;: the greater the benefactor, the smaller the benefitted; the smaller the benefitted, the more dependent on the benefactor — a self-locked loop.</p><p>Gu Chensha vs. Tang Luo comparison established in Entry 251. Gu Chensha went further than Tang Luo — he not only universal-benefited, he also carries for Myriad Ranks; he not only built an academy, he also creates universes. But &quot;going further&quot; does not equal &quot;going more right.&quot; Tang Luo at least let students cultivate themselves; Gu Chensha even cultivated for Myriad Ranks. Tang Luo&#39;s problem is &quot;built academy but not institutions&quot;; Gu Chensha&#39;s problem is more serious — he did not even build an academy; he directly lives for Myriad Ranks. <strong>Tang Luo is &quot;good-guy-version autocracy&quot;; Gu Chensha is &quot;saint-version autocracy.&quot;</strong> The latter is harder to oppose than the former, because opposing a saint sounds like ingratitude. But Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment does not abandon structural critique because the other party is a saint — autocracy is autocracy, even wearing a saint&#39;s robe.</p><p>Gu Chensha in the five-level standard ranks &quot;extremely high&quot; — single-log civilization&#39;s ceiling. He went further than Tang Luo (high · gift-style), and is more dangerous. Because Tang Luo at least let students practice themselves; Gu Chensha even practiced for Myriad Ranks. <strong>Tang Luo&#39;s problem is &quot;built school but not constitution&quot;; Gu Chensha&#39;s problem is &quot;did not even build school, directly lived for Myriad Ranks.&quot;</strong> This gap is the gap between &quot;high&quot; and &quot;extremely high&quot; — also between gift-style and single-log-style.</p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Tiandao Law, sky-mending, heaven-reforming, cosmos-creation boundaries late keep raising</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Combat power inflated to &quot;casually create universes&quot;; any new enemy must be bigger than universes</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extremely high</strong> (single-log; cosmos survival tied to Gu Chensha alone)</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cosmos-creation-tier energy used to &quot;carry for Myriad Ranks&quot;; civilization zero institutions</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: bearing sins for Myriad Ranks = robbing Myriad Ranks&#39; subjectivity</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Gu Chensha went further than Tang Luo, also more dangerous</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks nominally &quot;all can become dragons,&quot; actually all waiting for his gifts</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: single-log cosmos farthest from symbiotic network</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu Chensha is web fiction history&#39;s greatest &quot;good-guy ceiling.&quot; But Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment is cold: <strong>a cosmos that needs the number-one in history to carry it is itself a failed cosmos.</strong> True greatness is not carrying everything for Myriad Ranks, but letting Myriad Ranks learn they do not need you to carry it.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Rune · overview of Gu Chensha and single-log civilization qualitative assessment described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./251_模块2-唐罗体系拆解-总论三重上限与主角唯一性评判.html">Entry 251 · Tang Luo Overview</a> · <a href="./488_模块2-龙符-古尘沙掠夺思维拆解-替众生承罪的恩赐本质.html">Entry 488 · Gu Chensha&#39;s Predatory Thinking</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=i(s,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
